OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FContinuing changeable and often windy,
OL,7,Fwith spells of rain and showers moving
OL,8,Facross the UK, interspersed with drier
OL,9,Finterludes. Cool at first, exacerbated
OL,10,Fby the wind, but becoming much milder.
